Changes made: each model was converted from its original safetensors files to ONNX Runtime GenAI or OpenVINO format,
with 4-bit (int4) weights, using onnxruntime-genai's model builder or optimum-intel. The tokenizer and chat template
files are copied unchanged. The weights are otherwise not changed.

